enable
configure terminal

hostname SW2
no ip domain-lookup
ip domain-name POD71SW2.local

line console 0
password cisco
login

line vty 0 15
password cisco
transport input ssh
login local
exit

service password-encryption

username ciscouser privilege 15 secret cisco
crypto key generate rsa general-keys modulus 2048
ip ssh version 2

enable secret class

clock timezone CET 1

spanning-tree portfast bpduguard default 

int ran fa0/1 - 24
switchport mode access
shutdown

int fa0/18
no shutdown

int fa0/5
switchport mode trunk
switchport trunk native vlan 1
switchport nonegotiate
no spanning-tree portfast
no spanning-tree bpduguard
no shutdown

int vlan 1
ip add 172.168.1.2 255.255.255.0
no shutdown

ip default-gateway 172.168.1.1